<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Trust sees 97/98 oper profit at Y180 bln.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Trust sees 97/98 oper profit at Y180 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said it expects to post a parent operating profit of 180 billion yen in the current business year to March 31, 1998, compared with 373.29 billion yen in fiscal 1996/97.</p>
<p>The forecast was revealed by a senior Sumitomo Trust official after the bank announced its results for 1996/97.</p>
<p>The bank recorded 182.46 billion yen in operating profits in 1995/96.</p>
</text>
